# Instrument samples for the background tune. Only the voice actually used is
# committed and shipped; the alternates exist so the tune can be auditioned on a
# different instrument (npm run music:preview -- --instrument celesta) and would
# otherwise be 300 KB of precached audio nobody ever hears.
# Re-fetch them with: node tools/fetch-instruments.mjs
public/audio/instruments/*/
!public/audio/instruments/music_box/
!public/audio/instruments/glockenspiel/
